# TypeScript incremental build state. Committed by accident in cad44c6; it is regenerated by
# every `tsc` run, so tracking it makes a modified file appear in `git status` after any
# typecheck and puts build churn in every diff. Nothing reads it but tsc, and tsc rebuilds it.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
